# The development PKI and the compiled client. Both are generated, both are lab-only, and neither
# is a deliverable: the keys must be fresh on every run, and the binary is rebuilt by build.mjs.
.authlab/
authlab/bin/
# A stray `go build .` in either tool drops a binary beside the source; keep it out of git.
authlab/authlab
edge/edge
edge/sac-edge
# The lab's identity material (session and policy signing keys, the internal token, the directory
# key, the stand-in IdP's client secret) and the seed sealed from it: generated by build.mjs --auth,
# kept across builds so sealed rows stay readable, and never a deliverable.
.authlab-identity/
